      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. a bit worried about the \"held at the border\" part though. specifically with the transit visas—is there like a specific way the officers check the paperwork? like, are there common little mistakes or \"tricks\" they look for that cause people to get detained or sent back immediately? just want to make sure my team doesn't run into any unexpected trouble at the gates.",
